          "comment": "At the beginning of the resolution, each player counts up the number of creatures they control, then they make the required number of payments and/or sacrifices. The active player announces their choices first followed by the other players, but all the sacrifices are done at the same time. Because of this, you can\u2019t sacrifice one creature in order to pay for another and thereby avoid payment for the first."
